#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:2
msgid "How to setup single sign-on (SSO) with Google Workspace"
msgstr "如何设置与 Google Workspace 的单点登录（SSO）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/admonition-rtd-business.rst:2
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on `Read the Docs Business "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_."
msgstr "此功能仅在 `Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_ 上提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:6
msgid ""
"This how-to guide will provide instructions on how to enable :abbr:`SSO "
"(single sign-on)` with Google Workspace. If you want more information on "
"this feature, please read :doc:`/commercial/single-sign-on`"
msgstr ""
"本操作指南说明如何启用与 Google Workspace 的 :abbr:`SSO (single sign-on)` "
"。若想了解此功能的更多信息，请阅读 :doc:`/commercial/single-sign-on`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:11
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/organization-permissions.rst:2
msgid "Organization permissions"
msgstr "组织权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/organization-permissions.rst:4
msgid ""
"To change your :doc:`Organization's </commercial/organizations>` settings, "
"you need to be an *owner* of that organization."
msgstr "要更改 :doc:`组织 </commercial/organizations>` 的设置，你必须是该组织的*所有者* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/organization-permissions.rst:7
msgid "You can validate your ownership of the Organization with these steps:"
msgstr "可按以下步骤验证你对该组织的所有权："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/organization-permissions.rst:9
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `organization management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_detail/>`__."
msgstr ""
"前往 `organization management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_detail/>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/organization-permissions.rst:10
msgid "Look at the :guilabel:`Owners` section on the right menu."
msgstr "查看右侧菜单中的 :guilabel:`Owners` 区域。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/organization-permissions.rst:12
msgid ""
"If you'd like to modify this setting and are not an owner, you can ask an "
"existing organization owner to take the actions listed."
msgstr "若你想修改此设置但不是所有者，可请现有组织所有者执行上述操作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:16
msgid "Connect your Google account to Read the Docs"
msgstr "将你的 Google 账户连接到 Read the Docs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:18
msgid ""
"In order to enable the Google Workspace integration, you need to connect "
"your Google account to Read the Docs."
msgstr "要启用 Google Workspace 集成，你需要将 Google 账户连接到 Read the Docs。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:21
msgid ""
"The domain attached to your Google account will be used to match users that "
"sign up with a Google account to your organization."
msgstr "与你 Google 账户关联的域名将用于把使用 Google 账户注册的用户匹配到你的组织。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:24
msgid "User setup"
msgstr "用户设置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:26
msgid ""
"Using this setup, all users who have access to the configured Google "
"Workspace will automatically join to your organization when they sign up "
"with their Google account. Existing users will not be automatically joined "
"to the organization."
msgstr ""
"采用此设置后，所有有权访问所配置 Google Workspace 的用户在使用其 Google "
"账户注册时都会自动加入你的组织。现有用户不会自动加入组织。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:30
msgid ""
"You can still add outside collaborators and manage their access. There are "
"two ways to manage this access:"
msgstr "你仍可添加外部协作者并管理其访问权限。有两种管理方式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:33
msgid ""
"Using :doc:`teams </guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams>` to provide access "
"for ongoing contribution."
msgstr "使用 :doc:`团队 </guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams>` 为持续贡献提供访问权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:34
msgid ""
"Using :doc:`sharing </commercial/sharing>` to provide short-term access "
"requiring a login."
msgstr "使用 :doc:`共享 </commercial/sharing>` 提供需要登录的短期访问权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:37
msgid "Enabling SSO"
msgstr "启用 SSO"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:39
msgid ""
"By default, users that sign up with a Google account do not have any "
"permissions over any project. However, you can define which teams users "
"matching your company's domain email address will auto-join when they sign "
"up."
msgstr "默认情况下，使用 Google 账户注册的用户对任何项目都没有权限。但你可以指定：使用你公司域名邮箱地址的用户注册时自动加入哪些团队。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:42
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `authorization setting page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_sso/>`__."
msgstr ""
"前往 `authorization setting page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_sso/>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:43
msgid "Select **Google** in the :guilabel:`Provider` drop-down."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`Provider` 下拉框中选择 **Google** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:44
msgid "Press :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Save` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:46
msgid ""
"After enabling SSO with Google Workspace, all users with email addresses "
"from your configured Google Workspace domain will be required to signup "
"using their Google account."
msgstr ""
"启用与 Google Workspace 的 SSO 后，所有使用你配置的 Google Workspace 域邮箱地址的用户都必须使用其 Google"
" 账户注册。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:51
msgid ""
"Existing users with email addresses from your configured Google Workspace "
"domain will not be required to link their Google account, but they won't be "
"automatically joined to your organization."
msgstr "现有使用你配置的 Google Workspace 域邮箱地址的用户无需关联其 Google 账户，但也不会自动加入你的组织。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:55
msgid "Configure team for all users to join"
msgstr "配置所有用户加入的团队"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:57
msgid ""
"You can mark one or many teams that users are automatically joined when they"
" sign up with a matching email address. Configure this option by:"
msgstr "你可以标记一个或多个团队，使用匹配邮箱地址的用户注册时会自动加入。配置方式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:60
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `teams management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_team_list/>`__."
msgstr ""
"前往 `teams management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_team_list/>`__"
" 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:61
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`<team name>`."
msgstr "点击某个 :guilabel:`<team name>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:62
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Edit team`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Edit team`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:63
msgid "Enable *Auto join users with an organization's email address to this team*."
msgstr "启用 *Auto join users with an organization's email address to this team* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:64
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Save`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:66
msgid ""
"With this enabled, all users that sign up with their "
"``employee@company.com`` email will automatically join this team. These "
"teams can have either *read-only* or *admin* permissions over a set of "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"启用后，所有使用 ``employee@company.com`` 邮箱注册的用户都会自动加入该团队。这些团队对一组项目可以具有*只读* 或*管理员* "
"权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:71
msgid "Revoke user's access to all the projects"
msgstr "撤销用户对所有项目的访问权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:73
msgid ""
"By disabling the Google Workspace account with email "
"``employee@company.com``, you revoke access to all the projects the linked "
"Read the Docs user had access to, and disable login on Read the Docs "
"completely for that user."
msgstr ""
"停用邮箱为 ``employee@company.com`` 的 Google Workspace 账户，即撤销关联的 Read the Docs "
"用户对所有其可访问项目的权限，并完全禁用该用户在 Read the Docs 上的登录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:79
msgid ""
"If the user signed up to Read the Docs previously to enabling SSO with "
"Google Workspace on your organization, they may still have access to their "
"account and projects if they were manually added to a team."
msgstr ""
"若该用户在你组织启用 Google Workspace SSO 之前就注册了 Read the "
"Docs，且曾被手动添加到某个团队，他们可能仍能访问自己的账户和项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:82
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:90
msgid ""
"To completely revoke access to a user, remove them from all the teams they "
"are part of."
msgstr "要完全撤销某用户的访问权限，请将其从所有所属团队中移除。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:86
msgid ""
"If the user was already signed in to Read the Docs when their access was "
"revoked, they may still have access to documentation pages until their "
"session expires. This is three days for the dashboard and documentation "
"pages."
msgstr "若用户在访问权限被撤销时已登录 Read the Docs，他们可能仍能访问文档页面，直至会话过期。仪表盘和文档页面的会话有效期为三天。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-email.rst:94
msgid ":doc:`/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams`"

